WEBVTT

06:30.917 --> 06:33.711
- (COIN CLINKS)
- Your next tumble with Ros is on me.

06:34.671 --> 06:36.881
I'll try not to wear her out.

06:40.301 --> 06:41.177
(SIGHS)

06:41.678 --> 06:44.138
JON: Shoulder, legs.

06:48.643 --> 06:52.105
Leg, shoulder, leg.

06:53.231 --> 06:55.108
Left foot forward. Good.

06:55.233 --> 06:59.237
Now pivot as you deliver the stroke.
Put all your weight behind it.

06:59.362 --> 07:01.739
What in seven hells is that?
